~ start
[speed=1.0]It's November 7. Just one more day until my birthday![/speed]

[speed=1.0]I wonder if Nanay and Ate Valerie will really make my chocolate cake...[/speed]

[speed=1.0]They said they would! I can't wait![/speed]

NANAY: [speed=1.0]Ollie, anak! Are you done? We need to leave for the supermarket while it's still early![/speed]

VALERIE: [speed=1.1]Ollie, hurry up! We need to buy the candles, the rice, and... well, we still need to find the ingredients for your cake tomorrow. Come on![/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.0]I'm coming![/speed]

[speed=0.9]Everyone's waiting for me.[/speed]

[speed=0.9]I better hurry before Ate gets mad again.[/speed]

[speed=1.0]It's just a quick trip to the supermarket. We'll buy what we need and come home.[/speed]

[speed=0.9]Then tomorrow...[/speed]

[speed=1.0][wave amp=2 freq=3]I'll be eight![/wave][/speed]

=> END